WEBVTT

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:10.401
Welcome back, Mafuyu.

00:00:11.103 --> 00:00:12.934
I'm home, Tomo.

00:00:13.272 --> 00:00:15.908
Wait, how many times have we
had this conversation now?

00:00:15.908 --> 00:00:17.466
Well, I mean...

00:00:22.181 --> 00:00:25.548
I really am glad you're all right.

00:00:26.285 --> 00:00:29.277
I'm sorry I made you worry.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.457
Hup.

00:00:34.526 --> 00:00:37.552
I really am glad.

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.590
Yeah. Thank you.

00:00:45.938 --> 00:00:49.999
Anyway, those were difficult times, huh?

00:00:50.209 --> 00:00:55.112
Yeah, but I've gained complete control
over the Maria of the Sword.

00:00:55.381 --> 00:00:56.575
I'm okay now!

00:00:56.715 --> 00:00:59.650
That's awesome. You're so cool!

00:01:02.988 --> 00:01:07.425
I'm gonna control YOU, Mafuyu!

00:01:09.028 --> 00:01:10.757
Hey, Tomo!

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:13.464
What are you doing?!
Button A, Button B!

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.801
Dammit, Tomo!

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:18.829
Mafuyu, liftoff!

00:01:19.905 --> 00:01:23.705
Right! Left! Right-Up button!

00:01:26.178 --> 00:01:27.702
The Maria of the Sword...

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.844
There's no way idiots like this could control it.

00:01:32.418 --> 00:01:35.876
Oh, Tomo! I wish you'd hurry and notice me.

00:01:36.422 --> 00:01:38.822
I'll promise to take you with me.

00:01:40.859 --> 00:01:42.224
What are you staring at?

00:01:45.431 --> 00:01:46.557
It's a quest.

00:01:46.665 --> 00:01:47.825
You, too?

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:49.125
I challenge you!

00:01:49.201 --> 00:01:52.136
What are you calling a quest...

00:01:52.438 --> 00:01:54.804
you pervert?!

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:11.857
Trance, nureta tsumi ga yobu shoudou

00:02:11.857 --> 00:02:16.021
Modokashii aserasareta kodou

00:02:17.029 --> 00:02:20.829
Kimi wa aizu mo mushi datta

00:02:22.234 --> 00:02:27.035
Dandan to ronri ga kuruu to shittete

00:02:27.439 --> 00:02:31.842
Nerau inochi ga moeru

00:02:32.377 --> 00:02:37.549
Isshu no kairaku, itai yo, mune

00:02:37.549 --> 00:02:41.820
Afuresou na seihai

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:48.327
Shizumare, suberu made wa osaete

00:02:48.327 --> 00:02:55.300
Subete te ni iretai to kimeta, Lilith yo

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.769
Harisakesou, imademo

00:02:57.769 --> 00:03:01.406
Watashi o dakishimete

00:03:01.406 --> 00:03:05.677
Kurushimeru imi o misete

00:03:05.677 --> 00:03:11.617
Owarasero, saigo wa kokoro no kakera sae

00:03:11.617 --> 00:03:16.822
Kimi ga motomeru kyouchi ni wa todokisou ni nai

00:03:16.822 --> 00:03:19.424
I, I, I

00:03:19.424 --> 00:03:22.587
I'm in spiral

00:03:22.961 --> 00:03:25.794
Qwaser of Stigmata II

00:03:26.498 --> 00:03:29.368
Beautiful Challenger

00:03:29.368 --> 00:03:33.372
Alexander! Is my lecture that boring?

00:03:33.372 --> 00:03:36.675
My apologies. But yes, it is boring.

00:03:36.675 --> 00:03:37.309
Hey!

00:03:37.309 --> 00:03:39.072
In that case!

00:03:41.947 --> 00:03:43.938
But this is at collegiate level!

00:03:47.486 --> 00:03:50.011
Don't think you can beat me at chemistry.

00:03:50.289 --> 00:03:51.950
It's about winning and losing?

00:03:52.057 --> 00:03:55.652
He's forgotten how to live a normal life.

00:03:59.898 --> 00:04:01.763
< Nice breasts. >

00:04:02.201 --> 00:04:03.634
< You should be proud. >

00:04:04.536 --> 00:04:06.405
What are you doing?!

00:04:06.405 --> 00:04:08.202
If you were an enemy, I would've killed you.

00:04:12.044 --> 00:04:13.841
Mafuyu!

00:04:14.246 --> 00:04:15.314
I didn't see it.

00:04:15.314 --> 00:04:18.806
You better do something about
your urge to kill people!

00:04:19.151 --> 00:04:20.948
Death is always at hand.

00:04:21.253 --> 00:04:22.921
If you lower your guard, you die.

00:04:22.921 --> 00:04:25.190
And you let your guard down right now.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.525
You always have a comeback.

00:04:26.525 --> 00:04:28.459
Just apologize already.

00:04:30.862 --> 00:04:32.231
I'm sorry.

00:04:32.231 --> 00:04:38.192
My, Mafuyu has gotten rather strong
during her brief time away.

00:04:39.037 --> 00:04:43.633
That's why Miss Katja gets so irritated,
always around this lot, huh?

00:04:44.343 --> 00:04:46.038
What's with this atmosphere?

00:04:46.378 --> 00:04:48.539
Do they have no sense of danger?

00:04:50.048 --> 00:04:51.750
Sure enough, this is a foolish country.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:55.345
What was that? Dammit, Sasha! Wait there!

00:05:00.392 --> 00:05:03.088
Huh?! Sasha is "cool"?

00:05:04.529 --> 00:05:06.064
Are you a friggin' idiot?

00:05:06.064 --> 00:05:07.929
Please don't call me an idiot!

00:05:08.433 --> 00:05:11.163
Ma'am, do you have feelings for Sasha?

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:18.075
I-I-I, I said nothing like that to that effect!

00:05:18.277 --> 00:05:19.904
Now you're talking funny.

00:05:19.978 --> 00:05:23.882
Anyone bound by ideas of liking or
hating someone is just a fool!

00:05:23.882 --> 00:05:26.407
He already has Oribe, though.

00:05:27.452 --> 00:05:28.851
I know that!

00:05:29.488 --> 00:05:33.356
And, it's not a matter of liking or hating him...

00:05:34.159 --> 00:05:36.957
Yes! I want to get closer to him!

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.025
You have some weird tastes, don't you?

00:05:41.433 --> 00:05:42.525
BAM!

00:05:44.503 --> 00:05:46.733
You truly have strange tastes.

00:05:49.608 --> 00:05:53.237
Today, I shall do a special
no-appointment fortune telling.

00:05:53.345 --> 00:05:55.939
Yes! Madam Lilly!

00:05:56.281 --> 00:05:59.717
I wonder what happened to
Miyuri while I was gone...

00:06:00.319 --> 00:06:03.777
I suddenly... became host to the power of God!

00:06:05.624 --> 00:06:09.492
So frightful are my looks and talent that
I am beloved by God Himself!

00:06:09.628 --> 00:06:11.118
Wow!

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:14.895
I'm on my own today. But I'm sure I'll be fine.

00:06:19.171 --> 00:06:22.040
Madam Lilly's fortune-telling proclaims...

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.667
Proclaims!

00:06:26.311 --> 00:06:29.678
First there's despair, then hell and death.

00:06:30.782 --> 00:06:32.451
For a friend-making fortune telling?

00:06:32.451 --> 00:06:33.577
"Death"

00:06:33.852 --> 00:06:37.389
Honestly, you'd do well to go get an exorcism.

00:06:37.389 --> 00:06:38.287
How scary!

00:06:38.957 --> 00:06:40.424
Thank you.

00:06:41.159 --> 00:06:42.456
That's enough.

00:06:45.163 --> 00:06:47.290
My fortune-tellings are absolute!

00:06:47.399 --> 00:06:49.196
It was pretty bad this time.

00:06:50.135 --> 00:06:55.129
When Sasha disappeared from school,
I really did miss him.

00:06:56.141 --> 00:06:59.008
This time, I want to get close to him!

00:07:00.912 --> 00:07:02.675
That woman's an Adept.

00:07:03.048 --> 00:07:05.812
Why is she not monitored, allowed to roam free?

00:07:06.151 --> 00:07:08.210
Because there's no need.

00:07:08.854 --> 00:07:10.822
Her comrades tossed her aside.

00:07:10.822 --> 00:07:12.813
She's feeling conflicted.

00:07:13.892 --> 00:07:17.020
Incidentally, how is it being back at St. Mihailov?

00:07:17.529 --> 00:07:19.656
As always, it's a tepid place.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.601
You talk tough, don't you?

00:07:22.601 --> 00:07:24.967
Mafuyu forced me to come along.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.297
Well, let's leave it at that.

00:07:28.039 --> 00:07:30.064
Please take this time to restore your spirits.

00:07:30.609 --> 00:07:32.577
I'm always at 100%.

00:07:32.577 --> 00:07:36.411
We'd like you to stand by over there,
separate from our main forces.

00:07:36.782 --> 00:07:38.083
What's going on?

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:42.019
After the incident at Suirei Academy,
Meteora has been acting disturbingly.

00:07:42.354 --> 00:07:46.154
They may cook up some excuse that
will bring us in conflict with them.

00:07:47.292 --> 00:07:49.351
Sasha! Dinner's ready!

00:07:49.961 --> 00:07:51.263
Oh, my.

00:07:51.263 --> 00:07:52.730
Never mind them.

00:07:52.964 --> 00:07:54.032
Is that all right?

00:07:54.032 --> 00:07:56.134
I'LL decide when I eat.

00:07:56.134 --> 00:07:58.068
I told you dinner's ready!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.271
I heard you!

00:07:59.271 --> 00:08:03.731
I made this because you said you
really wanted to eat borscht today!

00:08:05.477 --> 00:08:06.445
I'm hanging up.

00:08:06.445 --> 00:08:08.504
Yes, yes. By all mea...

00:08:10.282 --> 00:08:12.546
It seems I don't have to worry about him.

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.517
Let's go. We have to hurry.

00:08:26.665 --> 00:08:30.465
Why am I living under the same roof as YOU?

00:08:31.069 --> 00:08:32.900
We could say the same thing.

00:08:33.605 --> 00:08:34.902
If you don't like it, get out.

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.075
Hey, Sasha!

00:08:37.075 --> 00:08:39.566
Thanks to this weird binding tool of yours...

00:08:42.681 --> 00:08:45.149
I can't leave the school grounds!

00:08:48.487 --> 00:08:50.079
Oh, that's right.

00:08:59.664 --> 00:09:00.892
What an insult.

00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:03.464
Jeter, don't worry about it.

00:09:03.802 --> 00:09:06.669
Once we figure things out,
I'm sure we can take it off.

00:09:06.771 --> 00:09:09.399
Figure what out? And when?!

00:09:09.875 --> 00:09:11.342
Shut up and eat.

00:09:20.552 --> 00:09:21.453
Tomo...

00:09:21.453 --> 00:09:23.011
Sasha.

00:09:23.188 --> 00:09:26.224
Please, don't be mean to Jeter.

00:09:26.224 --> 00:09:27.826
She's a heretic.

00:09:27.826 --> 00:09:31.853
Not all the Adepts were bad.

00:09:32.731 --> 00:09:35.825
There were lots of nice people, too.

00:09:37.903 --> 00:09:39.336
Tomo.

00:09:41.406 --> 00:09:42.674
Do as you like.

00:09:42.674 --> 00:09:46.701
Thank you, Sasha! That's great, right, Jeter?

00:09:47.012 --> 00:09:48.309
Tomo.

00:09:51.216 --> 00:09:52.342
Tomboy.

00:09:52.851 --> 00:09:54.045
You, too.

00:09:56.721 --> 00:10:02.159
Oh! We should change your
permanent residency to here!

00:10:02.494 --> 00:10:04.529
Qwasers have no such thing.

00:10:04.529 --> 00:10:06.463
That's too bad, isn't it?

00:10:06.665 --> 00:10:07.566
No, it's not.

00:10:07.566 --> 00:10:08.533
It's troubling, isn't it?

00:10:08.533 --> 00:10:08.733
What's with this dialogue?

00:10:08.733 --> 00:10:09.935
No, it isn't.

00:10:09.935 --> 00:10:10.769
That's too bad, isn't it?

00:10:10.769 --> 00:10:11.169
No, it's not.

00:10:11.169 --> 00:10:11.536
These guys sure are carefree.

00:10:11.536 --> 00:10:12.604
It's troubling, isn't it?

00:10:12.604 --> 00:10:13.038
No, it isn't.

00:10:13.038 --> 00:10:14.835
It's too bad. Too bad.

00:10:18.243 --> 00:10:20.545
So carefree, it boggles the mind.

00:10:20.545 --> 00:10:23.207
Japan is just the place to get some rest.

00:10:23.381 --> 00:10:25.849
We finally come back,
and you use me as a chair?!

00:10:26.051 --> 00:10:27.619
You like it.

00:10:27.619 --> 00:10:30.520
Yes! Please call me "Chair"!

00:10:31.389 --> 00:10:33.186
Keep your voice down!

00:10:34.726 --> 00:10:38.958
Come on! We played your
"abandonment game" for months!

00:10:40.265 --> 00:10:44.599
That's news to me.
I never gave you a second thought.

00:10:45.136 --> 00:10:49.664
You certainly are impudent for a mere slave.

00:10:51.543 --> 00:10:53.033
Hey. Are you listening?

00:10:53.912 --> 00:10:55.647
I can't stand it anymore!

00:10:55.647 --> 00:10:57.774
I want to lick you! Licky, licky!

00:11:00.785 --> 00:11:01.786
Hey.

00:11:01.786 --> 00:11:02.912
What are you doing?!

00:11:11.229 --> 00:11:12.731
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:11:12.731 --> 00:11:16.098
Do you get it? You should know your place.

00:11:16.468 --> 00:11:18.136
I'm a dung beetle!

00:11:18.136 --> 00:11:20.434
Please, call me "Dung Beetle," my queen!

00:11:20.905 --> 00:11:24.272
THIS is the holder of the Magdalene of Thunder?

00:11:24.809 --> 00:11:26.800
Things have gotten strange.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.804
More!

00:11:40.525 --> 00:11:43.928
Very well. I'll keep whipping you till dawn.

00:11:43.928 --> 00:11:47.056
Oh, Miss Katja!

00:11:48.299 --> 00:11:51.564
How long can you stay happy?

00:11:52.437 --> 00:11:53.734
Miss Katja!

00:12:02.547 --> 00:12:04.208
Good morning!

00:12:06.451 --> 00:12:09.011
Katsuragi! What happened?

00:12:09.688 --> 00:12:11.523
I had a dream.

00:12:11.523 --> 00:12:12.223
Huh?

00:12:12.223 --> 00:12:14.384
It was most welcome.

00:12:15.994 --> 00:12:17.562
Talk about a shock!

00:12:17.562 --> 00:12:19.621
What's this? Is she going to die?!

00:12:20.865 --> 00:12:22.628
What? You lookin' for a fight?!

00:12:23.702 --> 00:12:24.726
I don't know.

00:12:24.969 --> 00:12:26.027
Huh?

00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:30.864
So we ended up ditching class, huh?

00:12:31.076 --> 00:12:34.170
How can a Maria of Athos laugh like that?

00:12:34.479 --> 00:12:35.776
The others, too.

00:12:36.514 --> 00:12:40.211
My powers may be sealed, but I am your enemy.

00:12:40.418 --> 00:12:41.753
Don't worry about it.

00:12:41.753 --> 00:12:44.051
That thing with Suirei Academy is over with.

00:12:44.389 --> 00:12:47.256
But the fight between Athos
and the Adepts is NOT over!

00:12:47.592 --> 00:12:49.594
I don't care about that.

00:12:49.594 --> 00:12:51.118
You think that's enough?!

00:12:56.334 --> 00:12:58.199
Wh-What are you?

00:13:01.172 --> 00:13:02.298
That is...

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:05.008
The Magdalene of Thunder is inside me.

00:13:05.276 --> 00:13:09.474
It can't be removed.
That's a pretty heavy burden.

00:13:10.215 --> 00:13:11.182
So, what?

00:13:11.282 --> 00:13:13.750
You can't use your powers,
but you want to fight me?

00:13:14.619 --> 00:13:16.382
I'd intended to, but...

00:13:18.423 --> 00:13:21.392
When I look at you, I lose my will to fight.

00:13:24.362 --> 00:13:25.829
You makin' fun of us?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.260
Yes. I'm making fun of you.

00:13:28.967 --> 00:13:31.697
You're all naïve,
incapable of killing your enemies.

00:13:33.238 --> 00:13:34.603
You're upset, aren't you?

00:13:35.306 --> 00:13:38.503
Fine, I'll teach you how to fight without killing.

00:13:42.313 --> 00:13:44.338
Th-That's the fortune-telling mansion!

00:13:47.152 --> 00:13:53.580
It's an amusement facility being built by the
Tsujidou Conglomerate for all at our academy.

00:13:54.159 --> 00:13:54.659
Amu..?

00:13:54.659 --> 00:13:55.853
Also!

00:13:55.927 --> 00:13:59.761
We're preparing darts, billiard tables
and an aesthetic salon!

00:14:00.799 --> 00:14:03.927
We aim to be an all-purpose amusement facility!

00:14:06.738 --> 00:14:08.106
Hana Katsuragi!

00:14:08.106 --> 00:14:10.267
You call this "fighting without killing"?!

00:14:10.575 --> 00:14:13.601
Nice and peaceful, right?
And you can go all out!

00:14:17.248 --> 00:14:18.943
We still haven't opened yet.

00:14:19.083 --> 00:14:21.415
I've reserved it especially for today.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.982
Let's have a great welcome party
for our transfer student!

00:14:25.456 --> 00:14:27.759
Miyuri! Just what have you made?!

00:14:27.759 --> 00:14:29.226
Oh, dear. What's the problem?

00:14:29.694 --> 00:14:31.963
They look like Miyuri's breasts.
Everyone seems happy.

00:14:31.963 --> 00:14:33.698
Sister, it's wonderful!

00:14:33.698 --> 00:14:36.634
An idea somewhat beyond that
of the common man!

00:14:36.634 --> 00:14:38.469
Katja, you flatter me!
Ma'am, is this allowed?

00:14:38.469 --> 00:14:39.971
I protested, of course.

00:14:39.971 --> 00:14:43.107
But they collected consent forms from
almost 80% of the student body,

00:14:43.107 --> 00:14:44.342
so they pushed it through.

00:14:44.342 --> 00:14:45.443
Eighty percent?

00:14:45.443 --> 00:14:50.813
Virtue! Indeed, such is the extent
of my current popularity!

00:14:50.882 --> 00:14:53.908
Miyuri... What's she so worked up about?

00:14:54.152 --> 00:14:56.086
We were gone for a few months.

00:14:56.454 --> 00:14:59.116
Apparently, it was a lonely time for her.

00:14:59.524 --> 00:15:02.857
That's why she's acted so strangely,
becoming a breast fortune-teller?

00:15:03.061 --> 00:15:06.798
She's also been a comic-book author,
voice actress, and a comedienne.

00:15:06.798 --> 00:15:08.959
She's tried her hand at various things.

00:15:09.067 --> 00:15:12.503
Yet none of it could fill Miyuri's loneliness.

00:15:12.904 --> 00:15:14.462
SHUT UP!

00:15:14.839 --> 00:15:18.576
I just said that with the troublemakers gone,
things weren't that interesting, didn't I?!

00:15:18.576 --> 00:15:20.912
I-Indeed. Let's say that's what it was.

00:15:20.912 --> 00:15:22.311
That's enough talk!

00:15:23.715 --> 00:15:24.943
Sasha.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.049
This is a foolish game of balls.

00:15:27.218 --> 00:15:30.847
But I cannot lose to an Adept Qwaser.

00:15:31.055 --> 00:15:32.647
I challenge you, iron user!

00:15:33.057 --> 00:15:37.118
Even if I can't take your life,
I can break your spirit!

00:15:40.431 --> 00:15:42.661
I will shame you for all to see!

00:15:43.568 --> 00:15:45.866
If I lose, I'll do whatever you say.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.070
But there's not a chance that you'll win!

00:15:52.543 --> 00:15:55.808
As a Fourth-tier Qwaser, this should be...

00:15:57.682 --> 00:15:58.706
Tremble!

00:16:05.356 --> 00:16:06.550
He sucks?

00:16:07.058 --> 00:16:09.686
Oh. It's a gutterball.

00:16:10.528 --> 00:16:11.129
Impossible!

00:16:11.129 --> 00:16:13.326
Sasha

00:16:14.799 --> 00:16:16.266
It seems you're all talk.

00:16:17.368 --> 00:16:18.858
Don't look down on bowling!

00:16:19.037 --> 00:16:22.234
He called it a "foolish game
of balls" earlier, right?

00:16:22.407 --> 00:16:24.739
That ball is made of polyurethane.

00:16:25.209 --> 00:16:27.378
If it were metal, I would have succeeded.

00:16:27.378 --> 00:16:30.575
That would never happen.
But if it did, it'd be cheating.

00:16:31.616 --> 00:16:33.777
That foolish iron user dug his own grave.

00:16:34.319 --> 00:16:35.843
This challenge is now...

00:16:36.821 --> 00:16:39.016
mine for the winning!

00:16:48.266 --> 00:16:49.528
She sucks!

00:16:49.968 --> 00:16:53.563
Oh, my. That was a splendid gutterball.

00:16:54.105 --> 00:16:55.197
Impossible!

00:16:56.074 --> 00:16:57.939
This has just been warming up.

00:16:58.509 --> 00:17:01.103
This challenge is now... mine for the winning!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.447
NOOO!

00:17:04.682 --> 00:17:05.683
Incredible.

00:17:05.683 --> 00:17:06.517
Jeter

