00:17:06.551 --> 00:17:08.019
Sasha

00:17:08.019 --> 00:17:08.610
Sasha
This is one low-level battle.

00:17:08.953 --> 00:17:11.820
Conversely, it's incredible. Conversely.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.591
Tomo!

00:17:13.591 --> 00:17:14.717
Come with me!

00:17:18.863 --> 00:17:20.888
I'm in need of your soma!

00:17:21.265 --> 00:17:24.869
Huh? But saying something like
that out of the blue...

00:17:24.869 --> 00:17:32.110
I have to... to prepare myself...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.168
You're ready!

00:17:58.036 --> 00:18:01.836
Your soma is truly first rate, non-standard.

00:18:02.673 --> 00:18:04.971
With your soma, this battle...

00:18:05.309 --> 00:18:06.708
is mine for the winning!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.182
NOOO!

00:18:11.182 --> 00:18:14.151
Conversely, it's incredible. Conversely.

00:18:14.352 --> 00:18:16.877
What were you two doing outside?

00:18:18.689 --> 00:18:21.214
This was a waste of time. Let's go home.

00:18:34.705 --> 00:18:36.297
She's great!

00:18:43.414 --> 00:18:43.848
Thus...

00:18:43.848 --> 00:18:47.682
The winner is Fumika Mitarai.

00:18:47.785 --> 00:18:49.218
I did it!

00:18:49.554 --> 00:18:52.580
I lost... I lost to Fumika!

00:18:54.826 --> 00:18:57.260
I was utterly defeated. By HER.

00:18:57.929 --> 00:19:00.329
I have new respect for you, ma'am.

00:19:00.531 --> 00:19:02.431
Who knew you were good at THIS?

00:19:02.767 --> 00:19:09.502
Now then, to the victorious Miss Mitarai, Miyuri
Tsujidou presents Miyuri Tsujidou's presents of...

00:19:10.408 --> 00:19:12.740
Um, Sasha?

00:19:14.312 --> 00:19:18.214
