you'd do whatever you were told, right?

00:19:18.816 --> 00:19:20.443
Y-Yes.

00:19:20.952 --> 00:19:23.113
Don't tell me she's going to confess!

00:19:23.454 --> 00:19:25.752
Miss Katja, this will be one heck of a scene.

00:19:27.125 --> 00:19:30.117
No, Miss Mitarai! Your fortune told of death!

00:19:30.394 --> 00:19:33.261
S... Sasha!

00:19:35.099 --> 00:19:37.897
Um, you and I...

00:19:40.605 --> 00:19:42.072
You and I...

00:19:45.943 --> 00:19:48.377
Please get closer to us all!

00:19:51.983 --> 00:19:55.043
Okay! No more fighting, just get along!

00:19:55.186 --> 00:19:56.120
Huh?

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:57.355
What's this?

00:19:57.355 --> 00:20:01.655
I won! You have to do what
the winner says, right?

00:20:04.195 --> 00:20:07.062
Conflict with your classmates is forbidden!

00:20:07.331 --> 00:20:09.299
EVERYONE GET ALONG!

00:20:17.041 --> 00:20:20.499
