asked for a date or something.

00:20:21.879 --> 00:20:25.315
Still, if you COULD say that, you wouldn't
have suffered this whole time.

00:20:26.317 --> 00:20:29.912
Oh, that's right. It looks like Miyuri's
fortune missed the mark.

00:20:30.721 --> 00:20:32.188
Keep on living. 'Kay?

00:20:38.496 --> 00:20:40.521
So that was the Athos Qwaser...

00:20:42.166 --> 00:20:44.259
The Deadly One, Sasha.

00:20:45.036 --> 00:20:46.298
Edgar!

00:20:47.171 --> 00:20:48.706
