00:20:48.706 --> 00:20:50.765
O-Okay, Lilly.

00:20:51.175 --> 00:20:53.666
What were you doing here alone in the dark?

00:20:53.945 --> 00:20:57.176
I'm sorry, Lilly. Are you mad?

00:20:58.482 --> 00:21:01.349
Oh, jeez! You really are cute!

00:21:02.086 --> 00:21:07.251
A month ago, when I cared for you after you
collapsed, I thought I'd been visited by an angel!

00:21:07.592 --> 00:21:10.561
My luck has been amazing since you came!

00:21:10.761 --> 00:21:13.059
Even my fortune-telling accuracy
increased dramatically!

00:21:13.464 --> 00:21:16.524
Stay by my side and be my partner, okay?

00:21:17.535 --> 00:21:19.526
Yes! That makes me happy!

00:21:21.005 --> 00:21:23.132
You're so cute! So, so cute!

00:21:24.575 --> 00:21:27.908
At last I've met you... Deadly One, Sasha.

00:21:48.399 --> 00:21:54.805
Yuraida, hitaishou no kidou

00:21:54.805 --> 00:22:01.312
Jokyoku ni kazashita kousai

00:22:01.312 --> 00:22:07.585
Hikari no shuushisen wa hizunda mama

00:22:07.585 --> 00:22:13.182
Kashika sareta yume o kataru

00:22:15.059 --> 00:22:20.431
Yuuan na kyokou no shin'en ni

00:22:20.431 --> 00:22:26.504
Itsuka torawareta sekai o uchinuke

00:22:26.504 --> 00:22:28.472
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.472 --> 00:22:30.141
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.141 --> 00:22:33.344
Juuji o kire, fuzai no kami ni

00:22:33.344 --> 00:22:36.981
Kakusei no uta o kanadeshi koe wa

00:22:36.981 --> 00:22:39.817
Boutoku no tsurugi ka?

00:22:39.817 --> 00:22:41.419
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.419 --> 00:22:43.087
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.087 --> 00:22:46.824
Shadan sareta kimi to no oratorio

00:22:46.824 --> 00:22:49.694
Aisetsu o tsuki ga terashite

00:22:49.694 --> 00:22:55.291
Aoku kagayaku asu e no eve

